        "content" : "where u,v ∈ L(V,R). For simplicity, we denote Γ(u) := Γ(u,u) and Γ2(u) := Γ2(u,u). We say that G is CD(0,∞) if Γ2(u) ≥ 0 for all u ∈ L(G,R)."
